tual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0245","start":245,"end":247,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0274","start":274,"end":276,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0278","start":278,"end":280,"surface":"李由","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004894","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0285","start":285,"end":289,"surface":"楚盜陳勝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004908","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0291","start":291,"end":293,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0309","start":309,"end":311,"surface":"城守","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱、未定親屬或泛稱保留未解，不補名、世系或神名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0315","start":315,"end":316,"surface":"高","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004896","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0336","start":336,"end":338,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0348","start":348,"end":350,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004899","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0356","start":356,"end":358,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0365","start":365,"end":367,"surface":"使人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱、未定親屬或泛稱保留未解，不補名、世系或神名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m028-0377","start":377,"end":379,"surface":"李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-087-lisi","book_id":"b-shiji-087","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-087-lisi"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:p031","text":"於是二世乃使高案丞相獄，治罪，責斯與子由謀反狀，皆收捕宗族賓客。趙高治斯，榜掠千餘，不勝痛，自誣服。斯所以不死者，自負其辯，有功，實無反心，幸得上書自陳，幸二世之寤而赦之。李斯乃從獄中上書曰：「臣為丞相治民，三十餘年矣。逮秦地之狹隘。先王之時秦地不過千里，兵數十萬。臣盡薄材，謹奉法令，陰行謀臣，資之金玉，使游說諸侯，陰修甲兵，飾政敎，官鬬士，尊功臣，盛其爵祿，故終以脅韓弱魏，破燕、趙，夷齊、楚，卒兼六國，虜其王，立秦為天子。罪一矣。地非不廣，又北逐胡、貉，南定百越，以見秦之彊。罪二矣。尊大臣，盛其爵位，以固其親。罪三矣。立社稷，修宗廟，以明主之賢。罪四矣。更剋畫，平斗斛度量文章，布之天下，以樹秦之名。罪五矣。治馳道，興游觀，以見主之得意。罪六矣。緩刑罰，薄賦斂，以遂主得眾之心，萬民戴主，死而不忘。罪七矣。若斯之為臣者，罪足以死固久矣。上幸盡其能力，乃得至今，願陛下察之！」書上，趙高使吏棄去不奏，曰：「囚安得上書！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004899","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"高","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004896","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"子由","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004894","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0027","start":27,"end":31,"surface":"宗族賓客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱、未定親屬或泛稱保留未解，不補名、世系或神名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"趙高","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004896","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004899","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱、未定親屬或泛稱保留未解，不補名、世系或神名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0156","start":156,"end":158,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱、未定親屬或泛稱保留未解，不補名、世系或神名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"功臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱、未定親屬或泛稱保留未解，不補名、世系或神名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0246","start":246,"end":248,"surface":"大臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱、未定親屬或泛稱保留未解，不補名、世系或神名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0358","start":358,"end":359,"surface":"斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004868","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0394","start":394,"end":396,"surface":"趙高","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004896","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m031-0397","start":397,"end":398,"surface":"吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱、未定親屬或泛稱保留未解，不補名、世系或神名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-087-lisi","book_id":"b-shiji-087","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-087-lisi"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:p032","text":"趙高使其客十餘輩詐為御史、謁者、侍中，更往覆訊斯。斯更以其實對，輒使人復榜之。後二世使人驗斯，斯以為如前，終不敢更言，辭服。奏當上，二世喜曰：「微趙君，幾為丞相所賣。」及二世所使案三川之守至，則項梁已擊殺之。使者來，會丞相下吏，趙高皆妄為反辭。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"趙高","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004896","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0003","start":3,"e